BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260824T170000Z
DTEND:20260824T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260824T000000Z
SUMMARY:Newport Mall\, Near Cheesecake Factory- Myth\, Bookmobile Stop
DESCRIPTION:The Bookmobile of the Jersey City Free Public Library is a gift 
 from the Jersey City Free Public Library Foundation to the dedicated 
 patrons of the City. It is a disabled-accessible\, custom-designed 
 Bookmobile with two public access computers\, a DVD player for short 
 films\, and an eclectic collection of books.\n\nTo apply for a free library 
 card\, visit the Bookmobile and bring a photo ID and proof that you live\, 
 work or attend school in Jersey City.\n\nIn case of inclement weather or 
 mechanical issues\, JCFPL Bookmobile may be off the road or will arrive and 
 depart the destination at stated times. For updates\, information on 
 holiday closures\, locations\, and more visit 
 www.jclibrary.org/locations-a-hours/bookmobile. If the Bookmobile is not at 
 its site\, if you are interested in having the Bookmobile at your site\, 
 or\, if you have any comments or concerns\, please call: Mobile 000-000-0000 or Office 000-000-0000.
CATEGORIES:Red Schedule
UID:LibCal-17432-17226954
URL:https://jclibrary.libcal.com/event/17226954
END:VEVENT
