BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260829T150000Z
DTEND:20260829T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260829T000000Z
SUMMARY:BIPOC Pride Field Day\, Liberty State Park
DESCRIPTION:Join the JCFPL Outreach and Bookmobile Team at BIPOC Pride 
 Field Day at Liberty State Park! Stop by to sign up for a library card\, 
 and learn about the library's programs\, services\, and community 
 resources.\n\nThis inclusive community celebration features games\, 
 activities\, entertainment\, and opportunities to connect with local 
 organizations in a welcoming outdoor setting. We look forward to 
 celebrating community\, diversity\, and Pride with you!
CATEGORIES:August
UID:LibCal-17432-17228758
URL:https://jclibrary.libcal.com/event/17228758
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260831T160000Z
DTEND:20260831T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260831T000000Z
SUMMARY:Blood Drive @ JCFPL!
DESCRIPTION:Jersey City Free Public Library welcomes patrons and residents 
 of Jersey City to Priscilla Gardner Main Library's blood drive!\n\nSign up 
 with New Jersey Blood Services by scanning the QR code on the flyer\, or by 
 clicking HERE.\n\nWalk-ins welcome.
CATEGORIES:Popular Events > Family Events, Popular Events > Health and Wellness Events, Popular Events > Older Adults Events
UID:LibCal-17432-17569974
URL:https://jclibrary.libcal.com/event/17569974
