SUMMARY:Garden State Episcopal\, 514 Newark Ave. - Fable\, Bookmobile stop
DESCRIPTION:Fable will be at 514 Newark Ave to serve the community visiting 
 Garden State Community Development Corporation at the Garden State 
 Episcopal Church. We will be talking about library resources\, offering 
 library card sign ups with Fable\, our Bookmobile equipped with WiFi\, 
 printing\, and a small collection of books.\n\n10am - 12am.
