SUMMARY:NJ Symphony Arts & Music Festival Kids Day - Fable\, Bookmobile Stop
DESCRIPTION:Join JCFPL Bookmobile at the NJ Symphony Arts & Music Festival 
 Kids Day for a fun-filled day of music\, arts\, and family 
 activities!\n\nStop by the Bookmobile to explore books\, learn about 
 library resources\, and enjoy activities for kids and families.
