SUMMARY:Saturday Story hour with CAS: 'You Can do It All'
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an uplifting Story Hour celebrating confidence\, 
 imagination\, and the belief that anything is possible! Through engaging 
 storytelling\, fun activities\, and positive messages\, children will be 
 encouraged to dream big\, discover their unique strengths\, and remember 
 that they can do amazing things when they believe in themselves.\n\n\n
LOCATION:Offsite- please see description 
CATEGORIES:Popular Events > Community Awareness Series (CAS), Popular Events > Storytime Events
