SUMMARY:Bookmobile Grab & Go Craft Kit
DESCRIPTION:Take the fun home with a FREE Grab & Go Craft Kit from the 
 bookmobile!\n\n A different craft each month\, every kit comes with an 
 instructions.  Craft Kits are available during Bookmobile stops. 
 \n\nLimited kits available each day\, while supplies last. One kit per 
 child.
