SUMMARY:Bookmobile Fun- Guess How Many Candies Are in the Jar?
DESCRIPTION:Bookmobile Candy Jar Guessing Game\n\nThink you can guess how 
 many candies are in the jar? Stop by any of JCFPL Bookmobile\, take a 
 look\, and submit your best guess! One lucky winner will be announced after 
 the contest ends and will win the entire jar of candy! \n\nContest runs 
 October 1–29. Winner announced October 30.\nOne guess per person.\n\n
CATEGORIES:October, Popular Events > All-Ages Events
